        "lat": 38.6525,
        "lon": 39.3545,
        "text": "Mountain Rescue Unit 2 at km 14 on the pass road. Landslide covered the road, at least one car buried, we can hear a horn. We lose radio contact with base beyond the bend, need a relay."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": 6,
      "kind": "comm",
      "channel": "mesh",
      "payload": {
        "id": "M-1",
        "source_id": "mesh-school-teacher",
